  "Penetration": "防御貫通",
  "Zeraora previously received Penetration in Patch 1.18.1.2 Assault Break but developer notes failed to mention it. These notes are to record that UDB is now including them.": "補足：ゼラオラには1.18.1.2の時点で防御貫通が追加されていたが、公式説明には記載されていなかった。今回、取得元のデータにも反映された。",
  "Movement speed increase after landing changed: 30% for 2s → 60% decaying by 10% every 0.5s (minimum 30%) (total movement speed increase time unchanged at 2s).": "着地後の移動速度上昇：2秒間30%上昇 → 60%上昇し、0.5秒ごとに10%ずつ低下（最低30%）。持続時間は2秒のまま。",
  "Shield applied by Floral Healing or Sweet Kiss has been separated.": "フラワーヒールとてんしのキッスで付与されるシールドを、それぞれ別の扱いに変更。",
  "Cinderace previously received Percentage Penetration in Patch 1.18.1.2 Assault Break but developer notes failed to mention it. These notes are to record that UDB is now including them. More details are to follow as well as a reformat due to the use of percentage vs flat penetration like the speedsters as well as solidify the numbers": "補足：エースバーンには1.18.1.2の時点で割合による防御貫通が追加されていたが、公式説明には記載されていなかった。今回、取得元のデータに反映。スピード型の固定値による貫通とは異なるため、表示形式や詳しい数値は追加確認の予定。",
