  "Fixed a bug where Mewtwo X would become unable to Mega Evolve for the remainder of the match if they were knocked out immediately before Mega Evolving.": "メガシンカ直前にKOされると、その試合中はミュウツーXがメガシンカできなくなる不具合を修正。",
  "Fixed a bug where Mewtwo Y would become unable to Mega Evolve for the remainder of the match if they were knocked out immediately before Mega Evolving.": "メガシンカ直前にKOされると、その試合中はミュウツーYがメガシンカできなくなる不具合を修正。",
