  "Note: This means there would be a 0.25m increase in the range of the move and is easier to hit by hitbox intersecting enemy hitbox": "補足：射程が0.25m伸び、相手の当たり判定の端にも触れやすくなるため、技を当てやすくなった。",
  "Fixed a bug where, when dealing damage with Garchomp's boosted attack, additional damage or held item damage would occur before the boosted attack damage.": "ガブリアスの強化攻撃本体より先に、追加ダメージやもちもののダメージが発生する不具合を修正。",
